      "source_hash": 13975064611341351243,
      "context_hash": 2843506861632911039,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 ``-B`` 옵션과 동일합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:10.368072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Disable writing ``.pyc`` files.",
      "source_hash": 18125248766630248679,
      "context_hash": 4336259709214604411,
      "translation": "``.pyc`` 파일 작성을 비활성화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:10.368073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYTHONINSPECT``",
      "source_hash": 14885346071148921873,
      "context_hash": 14335085546666271392,
      "translation": "``PYTHONINSPECT``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:02.575646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, equivalent to the ``-i`` option.",
      "source_hash": 8014052012880709314,
      "context_hash": 17852238507257593718,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 ``-i`` 옵션과 동일합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:12.776728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Inspect interactively after running the specified script.",
      "source_hash": 156682917983666598,
      "context_hash": 15350552483079723637,
      "translation": "지정된 스크립트를 실행한 후 대화형으로 검사합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:12.776729Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYTHONIOENCODING``",
      "source_hash": 7844311486862894431,
      "context_hash": 16242576640849489308,
      "translation": "``PYTHONIOENCODING``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:16.186055Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "If this is set, it overrides the encoding used for *stdin*/*stdout*/*stderr*.",
      "source_hash": 3766034868602930155,
      "context_hash": 13394786873050778534,
      "translation": "이 값이 설정되면 *stdin*/*stdout*/*stderr*\\ 에 사용되는 인코딩을 재정의합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:33.769953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "The syntax is *encodingname*:*errorhandler* The *errorhandler* part is optional and has the same meaning as in `str.encode`.",
      "source_hash": 7893203670892351335,
      "context_hash": 15925873663571563964,
      "translation": "구문은 *encodingname*:*errorhandler*\\ 입니다. *errorhandler* 부분은 선택 사항이며, `str.encode`\\ 와 동일한 의미를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:33.769954Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYTHONNOUSERSITE``",
      "source_hash": 13644470830908547726,
      "context_hash": 2511794015621718145,
      "translation": "``PYTHONNOUSERSITE``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:19.304539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, equivalent to the ``-s`` option.",
      "source_hash": 9218768164716680289,
      "context_hash": 14896089429376530621,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 ``-s`` 옵션과 동일합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:33.016477Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Don't add the user site directory to `sys.path`.",
      "source_hash": 1543286269525283888,
      "context_hash": 9897045448739548554,
      "translation": "사용자 사이트 디렉터리를 `sys.path`\\ 에 추가하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:28:33.016478Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYTHONWARNINGS``",
      "source_hash": 11935215365048968824,
      "context_hash": 10223757697652376624,
      "translation": "``PYTHONWARNINGS``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:27:43.286323Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "If set, equivalent to the ``-W`` option (warning control).",
      "source_hash": 7832460263008402358,
      "context_hash": 12346162148191048906,
      "translation": "설정된 경우, ``-W`` 옵션(경고 제어)과 동일합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:07.058164Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "The value should be a comma-separated list of ``-W`` parameters.",
      "source_hash": 6211741447396851663,
      "context_hash": 11324174604551191335,
      "translation": "값은 쉼표로 구분된 ``-W`` 매개변수 목록이어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:07.058164Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYPYLOG``",
      "source_hash": 4422373098837847875,
      "context_hash": 6737408769850271346,
      "translation": "``PYPYLOG``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:02.911252Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, enable logging, the format is:",
      "source_hash": 7365448695913086392,
      "context_hash": 10914684828341940484,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 로깅을 활성화하며, 형식은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:05.509382Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "*fname* or *+fname*",
      "source_hash": 3601796537088342381,
      "context_hash": 13317357049313735559,
      "translation": "*fname* 또는 *+fname*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:07.117716Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "logging for profiling: includes all ``debug_start``/``debug_stop`` but not any nested ``debug_print``. *fname* can be ``-`` to log to *stderr*.",
      "source_hash": 17141681639526707406,
      "context_hash": 7743108355966982969,
      "translation": "프로파일링용 로깅: 모든 ``debug_start``/``debug_stop``\\ 을 포함하지만 중첩된 ``debug_print``\\ 는 포함하지 않습니다. *stderr*\\ 에 로그를 남기려면 *fname*\\ 을 ``-``\\ 로 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:32:07.133454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:18/seg:1",
      "source": "The *+fname* form can be used if there is a *:* in fname",
      "source_hash": 13758958056692661616,
      "context_hash": 11492597405640737133,
      "translation": "fname에 *:*\\ 가 있는 경우 *+fname* 형식을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:32:07.133454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "``:``\\ *fname*",
      "source_hash": 4311023426797624312,
      "context_hash": 17341029228138709868,
      "translation": "``:``\\ *fname*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:13.339593Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Full logging, including ``debug_print``.",
      "source_hash": 5219205813798899664,
      "context_hash": 14799474000969645902,
      "translation": "``debug_print``\\ 를 포함한 전체 로깅입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:09.455245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "*prefix*\\ ``:``\\ *fname*",
      "source_hash": 4000607329576258276,
      "context_hash": 4434912648604720939,
      "translation": "*prefix*\\ ``:``\\ *fname*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:10.969002Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "Conditional logging.",
      "source_hash": 13850164645551264368,
      "context_hash": 14000607126454009128,
      "translation": "조건부 로깅입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:10.133555Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:22/seg:1",
      "source": "Multiple prefixes can be specified, comma-separated.",
      "source_hash": 2594564533671735718,
      "context_hash": 8232034086513971208,
      "translation": "여러 접두사를 쉼표로 구분하여 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:10.133557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:22/seg:2",
      "source": "Only sections whose name match the prefix will be logged.",
      "source_hash": 12516721199237563014,
      "context_hash": 6408677358161573787,
      "translation": "이름이 접두사와 일치하는 섹션만 로깅됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:10.133557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYPYLOG=jit-log-opt,jit-backend:logfile`` will generate a log suitable for *jitviewer*, a tool for debugging performance issues under PyPy.",
      "source_hash": 12241057405542794397,
      "context_hash": 11878685539861883737,
      "translation": "``PYPYLOG=jit-log-opt,jit-backend:logfile``\\ 는 PyPy에서 성능 문제를 디버깅하는 도구인 *jitviewer*\\ 에 적합한 로그를 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:15.984537Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYPY_IRC_TOPIC``",
      "source_hash": 13091035582600974673,
      "context_hash": 1883859767631451427,
      "translation": "``PYPY_IRC_TOPIC``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:31:52.947394Z",
      "issues": [
        "Both \"Source\" and \"Translation\" contain the identical unresolved placeholder token `PYPY_IRC_TOPIC` rather than actual text, so there is no real translation to evaluate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, print a random #pypy IRC topic at startup of interactive mode.",
      "source_hash": 6101223806158410400,
      "context_hash": 15557445000980840608,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 대화형 모드 시작 시 #pypy IRC 주제를 무작위로 출력합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:17.481321Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYPY_DISABLE_JIT``",
      "source_hash": 10970498538786432249,
      "context_hash": 7456074127619455681,
      "translation": "``PYPY_DISABLE_JIT``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:29:15.275707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, disable JIT.",
      "source_hash": 4454563975526694127,
      "context_hash": 7751103943306772941,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 JIT을 비활성화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:31:53.393720Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:28/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYTHON_DISABLE_REMOTE_DEBUG``",
      "source_hash": 9204843209054648909,
      "context_hash": 10857493740127578871,
      "translation": "``PYTHON_DISABLE_REMOTE_DEBUG``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:31:52.881721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:29/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, disable the remote debugging interface.",
      "source_hash": 14037476050803297487,
      "context_hash": 9220146964409294059,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 원격 디버깅 인터페이스를 비활성화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:31:53.528717Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
